# next build's type-check worker needs more heap than Node's default cap
# (~half of physical RAM — under 2048 MB on a 1 GB droplet, and swap does
# not raise it). Setting it here, in the repository, means every npm
# script gets the headroom no matter which wrapper invoked it — deploy
# scripts, CI, or a manual `npm run build` (demo-hosting.md).
node-options=--max-old-space-size=2048
